    "ITEM_BORBOBAKEDBEANS_NAME": "悲剧之豆",
    "ITEM_BORBOBAKEDBEANS_PICKUP": "击杀时立即治疗。连续击杀治疗更多。",
    "ITEM_BORBOBAKEDBEANS_DESCRIPTION": "击杀时<style=cIsHealing>恢复8点生命值</style><style=cStack>（每层+4）</style>。同时获得一个<style=cIsUtility>临时增益</style>，使此治疗量<style=cIsHealing>每层增益增加12点</style><style=cStack>（每层+6）</style>，最多叠加<style=cIsUtility>4次。</style>",
