    "2R4R_INTERACTABLE_FLOWERBLOOM_CONTEXT": "好漂亮，啊，真是太漂亮了…",
    "2R4R_INTERACTABLE_SHRINE_CONVERGE_NAME": "汇聚神龛",
    "2R4R_INTERACTABLE_SHRINE_CONVERGE_CONTEXT": "向汇聚神龛祈祷",
